{\b ArrowKeys}
\par Hold Caps Lock and use J, K, L and I as arrow keys. U and O move to the edges of the line. H and the semicolon key move by word.
\par This package includes Karabiner-Elements and its virtual keyboard driver. Installer adds any missing components and enables the ArrowKeys rule for the signed-in user. Existing profiles are preserved.
